prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 54% of normal in Oct-Nov and 42% in Nov-Dec. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids got 42% of normal in Jan-Feb, then 208% in May to June.</p>"}
